{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>חדל בני</b> — Cease, my son, to stray words of knowledge, and hear discipline. Another interpretation: the beginning of this verse is joined to its end, thus: Cease, my son, from words of knowledge if you desire to hear discipline, and afterwards to stray."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:42.899034415Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}